{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e30e825c666138658b888e34dcee19fef757f210fc47e7d374e2a0dc3454ba10", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのアイドルになってくれそうな子を\n捜しに来たが……。なかなか、いい子がいないな）", "zh": "（我出来寻找39PROJECT的偶像人选……\n但都没看到适合的女孩呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "e35d80567a8d12a5ebea9c2618206f7cb38df10a97a37c986fc12b161e6c1aea", "ja": "にゃははっ♪\nそれホント？　すっごく面白いじゃん！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪\n你是说真的吗？超好笑的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1e86787b6391ff722e7cdf6c96ac03fadd6c1507773f0511b30bf3fe43c2c5ec", "ja": "（あそこで、友達と話してるあの子……オシャレだし、\nスタイルがいいな。何より、いい笑顔だ）", "zh": "（旁边那个正在跟朋友说话的女孩……\n她又时髦，身材也好。最重要的是笑容很灿烂呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9ddebabe411d46d0f34ee0580aa7522ed32d0b414b4869100bab851189c7d2e1", "ja": "あの、ちょっといいかな？", "zh": "不好意思，请问你有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "3fdbee40c7e951ce7ad09c3466e0a860c761a29c753d2f7eddf600e56d9131dd", "ja": "え？　アタシ？\nなになに、どしたの？", "zh": "咦？问我吗？\n什么什么，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "1e7fc36cbcfe6ea63c54b7bafe1c9275a72c24020e51c0873f1aaaada3a3508c", "ja": "あ！　もしかして、道に迷っちゃったとか～？\nにゃははっ、大人なのにしょうがないな～！", "zh": "啊！你该不会迷路了～？\n呀哈哈，明明都是大人了，真拿你没办法～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "8fe2434b94b6600fd32d0d2ed3f5aa616a8956a99a68fdf0f7b4eeff31b5e61c", "ja": "いいよ、道案内したげる！\nお兄さん、どこ行きたいの？", "zh": "好，我就帮你带路吧！\n大哥，你想去哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8fc6656ba7493bb21d117f6fa7a3204c6eaa5d98d0dba991f4c890f964362269", "ja": "（初対面なのに、気さくだな。このコミュニケーション\n能力は、きっとアイドルになっても役に立つぞ！）", "zh": "（虽然是初次见面，她却很大方呢。\n这份沟通能力在当偶像时一定也会派上用场的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_1008", "source_sha256": "af64cb5745e12f46015965a25065eec951dbf0fe41fc1cee6cc18e96b64fe4f6", "ja": "名刺を取り出す", "zh": "拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "15a4bbcdd8cfd27ecb423ac088915c3ce1a3c066a9b7920f84ca09ed7f0fd00e", "ja": "実は、こういうものなんだけど……。\n君、アイドルに興味ないかな？", "zh": "其实我是做这个的……\n你对当偶像有兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2001_020meg", "source_sha256": "3061ed96cec720163942acc7161e8c7f2025974181fe77ef27573ef3f6ed942e", "ja": "アイドルのスカウト？\nアイドルって……あ、アタシが！？", "zh": "你在发掘偶像？\n当偶像……是、是说我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2002_020meg", "source_sha256": "29756a7dc9ccc37213749f69ce1c9edf6c8939e31f0ddc01c9e3c0379934b6af", "ja": "またまた～！\nお兄さん、面白いコト言うね！", "zh": "哎呀呀～！\n大哥你真会说笑啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "051ff851172215adc1101665b33b6f9c9d4103569762b1de4ca0627c05ed7a77", "ja": "いや、冗談とかじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不，我不是在开玩笑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2004_020meg", "source_sha256": "94dfb82ab1d1f4c0cbd26e0e9af91ef89f4877d1a5f72a4674d8e041f022e33a", "ja": "アタシ、読モはやってるけどさ。でも、アイドルに\nなってくれなんて言われたのは、流石に初めてだよ～。", "zh": "我是有在当读者模特儿啦，\n但这还是第一次被问要不要当偶像耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "8971698258dfc18c08bebcd9a244f009eff5e07b64f36cd3ff2d1ec5670cc3ee", "ja": "（読者モデル……そうだったのか。\nどうりで雰囲気が違うはずだ）", "zh": "（读者模特儿……原来如此，\n难怪她的气质跟旁人不太一样。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "681977071415c559729c8f47af69451335bf94a3634ac98432a4778857317a9b", "ja": "よかったら、考えてみてくれないかな？\n君ならきっと、アイドルとして輝けると思う！", "zh": "方便的话，你可以考虑看看吗？\n我想你一定能作为偶像发光发热的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2007_020meg", "source_sha256": "f60c0d23d9c945fb8d64f74d5d580e8cae2bba6dea002dd65244b2e586769392", "ja": "あ、あれ？\nもしかして……本気で言ってる？", "zh": "咦，奇怪？\n该不会……你是认真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2008_020meg", "source_sha256": "b92ffddd70bff43dcbd3fb93fb1080c1a8ade4ce1dac238660a473567a2c2b5d", "ja": "まいったな～。アイドルって言ったらさ、アレでしょ？\n人前で歌ったり踊ったりする……。", "zh": "伤脑筋～说到偶像，就是那个对吧？\n要在人前唱歌跳舞之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2009_020meg", "source_sha256": "58e05f27d98f4dc76baac8c49ae5430b944d4d89201224b8f877f4d9a725384a", "ja": "いやいやいやいや、ムリムリムリムリムリムリムリ！\nアタシが人前で歌うとか、そんなのあり得ないでしょ！", "zh": "不不不不，不行不行不行不行不行不行不行！\n要我在人前唱歌，怎么可能办得到啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "55d7db3334ea2b27b0b72bfd95aafbacb9e364bce157177193055dbfa0429f19", "ja": "返事は今じゃなくていいから、\n名刺だけでも受け取ってくれないか？", "zh": "你用不着马上答复，\n但可以先收下名片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2011_020meg", "source_sha256": "b3d3dd45d8a110d6bdd0993b2644784c1ed1f05d2b33c24a54c2c09e115a11ac", "ja": "まあ、名刺ぐらいならもらってもいいけど……。", "zh": "嗯，只是名片的话是可以收啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2012_020meg", "source_sha256": "2617de5a587eb8689f46ca93e750ba3c9d1e1b9c40c3485d268f4434f1de22f1", "ja": "でも、期待しないでよ？\nガッカリさせるのイヤだからさ。", "zh": "不过可别抱持期待喔。\n因为我不想让你失望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2013_null", "source_sha256": "f82334b003bac14b1e94cd70660c4c0933a534c5af3da28711caf10c6ee1a854", "ja": "そして、数日後……", "zh": "而几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2014_020meg", "source_sha256": "dc94c93763539c85702d1f3aa19ba3d90687775970f2625b2907568b0477b890", "ja": "あっ、いたいた！\nこの間の人、見っけ♪", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了！\n是之前那个人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "146421397730e0a0c90c50f6a1cf35eb54087a01810b4406a0bc45d4a6425f92", "ja": "君は、あの時の！\n事務所に来てくれたってことは、もしかして……。", "zh": "你是那时的女孩！\n既然都来到了事务所，该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2016_020meg", "source_sha256": "58061dfeedf0bdb0ca24e0b50199d0ac574d10187396669a20de9d826a06793c", "ja": "にゃははっ、正解♪", "zh": "呀哈哈，答对了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2017_020meg", "source_sha256": "55c3aea2ea8b9b3392c8ceb6ffae65b4b0935090d8cbc78d05cc56cf1c81f271", "ja": "あの後、友達に「せっかくだしやってみれば」\nって言われちゃってさ～。", "zh": "因为之后朋友跟我说\n「机会难得，不如试试看」～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2018_020meg", "source_sha256": "3301a154d3b8daf550ae77acf3682bca0fea970648af561acce6a77f9d35a53f", "ja": "仲間が背中を押してくれてるのに、\nそれに応えないなんて、なんかイヤじゃん？", "zh": "伙伴都从背后推我一把了，\n要是没回应她们的期待，总觉得不舒坦嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2019_020meg", "source_sha256": "b524892c45ca542c34c5445b80bd0d34c1d850660a07d45ed678a95da48ef9fb", "ja": "そういうわけで、アイドルになることにしたよ！\nあっ、アタシの名前は所恵美。よろしくね！", "zh": "就是这样，所以我决定要当偶像了！\n啊，我的名字是所惠美，请多多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2020_p", "source_sha256": "8626d18b8ae644aa79e648c77f8c30ff736f85723c7bd27079ddd3dabc2ac928", "ja": "ああ、こちらこそよろしく！", "zh": "嗯，我也要请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_001_2021_p", "source_sha256": "67baadb80383a04337b565888ce8fa6d2f452be0d01c982b8b0cc70908049daa", "ja": "（「期待に応えたい」という気持ちは、アイドルに\n必要な素質だ。これは、今後も期待できそうだぞ！）", "zh": "（「想回应他人期待」的想法，是偶像必备的素质。\n看来她今后的发展大有可期喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
